{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"03.02","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":145,"reply_count":27,"alternative_count":14,"total_audio_count":186,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"03.02.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我要打扫房间了。","meaning_my":"အခန်း သန့်ရှင်းရေးလုပ်တော့မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，我和你一起打扫。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အတူတူ သန့်ရှင်းရေးလုပ်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"今天谁打扫？","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ ဘယ်သူ သန့်ရှင်းရေးလုပ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"今天轮到你打扫了。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ မင်း သန့်ရှင်းရေးလုပ်ရမယ့် အလှည့်နော်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"地上很脏。","meaning_my":"ကြမ်းပြင် အရမ်းညစ်ပတ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那我先把东西收起来。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ပစ္စည်းတွေ အရင် သိမ်းလိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S004_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"地板太脏了。","meaning_my":"ကြမ်းပြင် အရမ်းညစ်ပတ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S004_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"先扫地。","meaning_my":"အရင် တံမြက်စည်းလှည်းလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S005_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"先把地扫一下。","meaning_my":"ကြမ်းပြင်ကို အရင် တံမြက်စည်းလှည်းလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S005_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"再拖地。","meaning_my":"ပြီးမှ ကြမ်းတိုက်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"扫把放哪儿了？","meaning_my":"တံမြက်စည်း ဘယ်မှာထားလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"扫把就在门后。","meaning_my":"တံမြက်စည်းက တံခါးနောက်မှာပဲ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"拖把在哪儿？","meaning_my":"ကြမ်းတိုက်တံ ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"在卫生间旁边。","meaning_my":"အိမ်သာဘေးမှာ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"抹布在哪儿？","meaning_my":"သန့်ရှင်းရေးသုံး အဝတ်စ ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"垃圾袋在哪儿？","meaning_my":"အမှိုက်အိတ် ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"垃圾先倒掉。","meaning_my":"အမှိုက် အရင် သွားပစ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S011_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"先把垃圾扔了。","meaning_my":"အမှိုက် အရင် သွားပစ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S011_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"垃圾顺手带下去。","meaning_my":"အောက်ဆင်းရင်း အမှိုက်လည်း ယူသွားပေးနော်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"先把垃圾装进袋子里。","meaning_my":"အမှိုက်တွေ အရင် အိတ်ထဲ ထည့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"桌子也要擦。","meaning_my":"စားပွဲလည်း သုတ်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"这里要擦一下。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာကို နည်းနည်း သုတ်ပေးဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"再擦一遍。","meaning_my":"နောက်တစ်ခါ ထပ်သုတ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"这里没扫干净。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာကို သေချာ မလှည်းရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"地板还没干，先别踩。","meaning_my":"ကြမ်းပြင် မခြောက်သေးဘူး၊ မနင်းနဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"打扫完了。","meaning_my":"သန့်ရှင်းရေး လုပ်ပြီးပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"客厅也要打扫吗？","meaning_my":"ဧည့်ခန်းလည်း သန့်ရှင်းရေး လုပ်ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S021","kind":"main","cn":"卫生间还没打扫。","meaning_my":"အိမ်သာကို သန့်ရှင်းရေး မလုပ်ရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S022","kind":"main","cn":"床底下也扫一下。","meaning_my":"ကုတင်အောက်လည်း လှည်းပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S023","kind":"main","cn":"窗户也擦一下吧。","meaning_my":"ပြတင်းပေါက်လည်း သုတ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S024","kind":"main","cn":"这里有水，先擦干。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ရေစိုနေတယ်၊ အရင် ခြောက်အောင် သုတ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S025","kind":"main","cn":"拖把用完放哪儿？","meaning_my":"ကြမ်းတိုက်တံ သုံးပြီးရင် ဘယ်မှာထားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S025_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"放阳台吧。","meaning_my":"ဝရန်တာမှာ ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S025_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S026","kind":"main","cn":"灰尘好多。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်တွေ အများကြီးပဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S027","kind":"main","cn":"角落也要扫。","meaning_my":"ထောင့်တွေကိုလည်း လှည်းပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S028","kind":"main","cn":"开窗通通风。","meaning_my":"ပြတင်းပေါက်ဖွင့်ပြီး လေဝင်လေထွက် ကောင်းအောင် လုပ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S029","kind":"main","cn":"地毯吸一下。","meaning_my":"ကော်ဇောကို ဖုန်စုပ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S030","kind":"main","cn":"这里还有头发。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ဆံပင်တွေ ကျန်နေသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S031","kind":"main","cn":"书架上的灰擦一下。","meaning_my":"စာအုပ်စင်ပေါ်က ဖုန်တွေ သုတ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S031.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S032","kind":"main","cn":"拖把拧干一点。","meaning_my":"ကြမ်းတိုက်တံကို နည်းနည်း ပိုညှစ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S032.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.01-S033","kind":"main","cn":"打扫完记得洗手。","meaning_my":"သန့်ရှင်းရေးလုပ်ပြီးရင် လက်ဆေးဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့။","audio_file":"03.02.01-S033.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我要洗衣服。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်လျှော်ဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，洗衣液在这儿。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အဝတ်လျှော်ဆပ်ပြာရည် ဒီမှာရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"洗衣机怎么用？","meaning_my":"အဝတ်လျှော်စက် ဘယ်လိုသုံးရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"按这个键就开始洗了。","meaning_my":"ဒီခလုတ်နှိပ်လိုက်ရင် လျှော်တာ စတော့မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这台洗衣机怎么操作？","meaning_my":"ဒီအဝတ်လျှော်စက်ကို ဘယ်လိုသုံးရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"洗衣液倒哪儿？","meaning_my":"အဝတ်လျှော်ဆပ်ပြာရည် ဘယ်နေရာမှာ ထည့်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"倒在这个格子里。","meaning_my":"ဒီအကန့်ထဲ ထည့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S004","kind":"main","cn":"洗衣液放多少？","meaning_my":"အဝတ်လျှော်ဆပ်ပြာရည် ဘယ်လောက်ထည့်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"衣架在哪儿？","meaning_my":"အင်္ကျီချိတ် ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"衣架在阳台。","meaning_my":"အင်္ကျီချိတ်တွေ ဝရန်တာမှာရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S006","kind":"main","cn":"衣服晾哪儿？","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ ဘယ်မှာလှန်းရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"晾在阳台上。","meaning_my":"ဝရန်တာမှာ လှန်းလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S007","kind":"main","cn":"帮我晾一下衣服。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ လှန်းပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S008","kind":"main","cn":"衣服洗好了。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ လျှော်ပြီးပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S009","kind":"main","cn":"衣服还没干。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ မခြောက်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"衣服还没晾干。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ မခြောက်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S010","kind":"main","cn":"外面下雨了，快收衣服。","meaning_my":"အပြင်မှာ မိုးရွာနေပြီ၊ အဝတ်တွေ မြန်မြန် သိမ်းလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S011","kind":"main","cn":"深色和浅色要分开洗吗？","meaning_my":"အရောင်ရင့်တဲ့အဝတ်နဲ့ အရောင်ဖျော့တဲ့အဝတ်ကို ခွဲလျှော်ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"这件要手洗吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ထည်ကို လက်နဲ့ လျှော်ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，这件不能机洗。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ ဒီတစ်ထည်ကို စက်နဲ့ လျှော်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"这件要单独洗。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ထည်ကို သီးသန့် လျှော်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"这件不能机洗。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ထည်ကို စက်နဲ့ လျှော်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S014_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这件不能用洗衣机洗。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ထည်ကို အဝတ်လျှော်စက်နဲ့ လျှော်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S014_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S015","kind":"main","cn":"床单要单独洗吗？","meaning_my":"အိပ်ရာခင်းကို သီးသန့် လျှော်ရမလား။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S016","kind":"main","cn":"衣服洗完记得拿出来。","meaning_my":"လျှော်ပြီးရင် အဝတ်တွေ စက်ထဲက ထုတ်ဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S017","kind":"main","cn":"衣服干了可以收了。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ ခြောက်ပြီ၊ သိမ်းလို့ရပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S018","kind":"main","cn":"这件衣服掉色。","meaning_my":"ဒီအဝတ်က အရောင်ကျတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S019","kind":"main","cn":"这件要翻过来洗。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ထည်ကို အတွင်းဘက်လှန်ပြီး လျှော်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S020","kind":"main","cn":"领口袖口搓一下。","meaning_my":"ကော်လာနဲ့ အင်္ကျီလက်အစွန်းတွေကို နည်းနည်း ပွတ်ဆေးလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.02-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.02-S021","kind":"main","cn":"洗