ရွက်တွေ ဆေးလိုက်မယ်၊ လှီးပေးနော်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"这个熟了吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ကျက်ပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"熟了，可以吃了。","meaning_my":"ကျက်ပြီ၊ စားလို့ရပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"这个还没熟。","meaning_my":"ဒါ မကျက်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"这个煮多久？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ဘယ်လောက်ကြာကြာ ပြုတ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"煮十分钟左右。","meaning_my":"ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် ပြုတ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"水开了吗？","meaning_my":"ရေ ဆူပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"开了，可以放菜了。","meaning_my":"ရေဆူပြီ၊ ဟင်းသီးဟင်းရွက်တွေ ထည့်လို့ရပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S007_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"水烧开了吗？","meaning_my":"ရေ ဆူပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S007_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"油热了吗？","meaning_my":"ဆီ ပူပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"热了，可以下锅了。","meaning_my":"ဆီ ပူပြီ၊ ထည့်ကြော်လို့ရပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"放点盐。","meaning_my":"ဆား နည်းနည်း ထည့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"盐少放一点。","meaning_my":"ဆား နည်းနည်းပဲ ထည့်နော်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"盐放这么多够吗？","meaning_my":"ဆား ဒီလောက်ထည့်ရင် လုံလောက်ပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S011_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"够了，别再放了。","meaning_my":"လုံလောက်ပြီ၊ ထပ်မထည့်နဲ့တော့။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S011_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"要切成多大块？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လောက်အရွယ်အစား လှီးရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"切小块一点。","meaning_my":"အသေးလေးတွေ လှီးလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"火再小一点。","meaning_my":"မီး နည်းနည်း ထပ်လျှော့လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S013_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"把火调小点。","meaning_my":"မီး နည်းနည်း လျှော့လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S013_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"等水开了再放进去。","meaning_my":"ရေဆူမှ ထည့်နော်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"再煮五分钟。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ငါးမိနစ် ပြုတ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"先把肉解冻。","meaning_my":"အသားကို အရင် ရေခဲပျော်အောင်ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"肉还冻着呢。","meaning_my":"အသားက အေးခဲနေတုန်းပဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"剩下的先放冰箱。","meaning_my":"ကျန်တာတွေကို ရေခဲသေတ္တာထဲ အရင် ထည့်ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"饭在锅里，热一下就行。","meaning_my":"ထမင်းက အိုးထဲမှာ ရှိတယ်၊ ပြန်နွှေးလိုက်ရုံပဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"蒜剥一下。","meaning_my":"ကြက်သွန်ဖြူ အခွံခွာပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"先腌一下肉。","meaning_my":"အသားကို အရင် အရသာနယ်ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"放多少酱油？","meaning_my":"ပဲငံပြာရည် ဘယ်လောက်ထည့်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先放一勺吧。","meaning_my":"အရင် တစ်ဇွန်းလောက် ထည့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S022_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"尝尝咸淡。","meaning_my":"အငန်အပေါ့ မြည်းကြည့်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S024","kind":"main","cn":"太淡了，加点盐。","meaning_my":"အရသာ ပေါ့လွန်းတယ်၊ ဆား နည်းနည်းထည့်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S025","kind":"main","cn":"太咸了。","meaning_my":"ငန်လွန်းတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S026","kind":"main","cn":"火太大了。","meaning_my":"မီး ပြင်းလွန်းနေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S027","kind":"main","cn":"糊了。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတူးသွားပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S028","kind":"main","cn":"翻一下面。","meaning_my":"တစ်ဖက်လှန်လိုက်ဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S029","kind":"main","cn":"盖上锅盖。","meaning_my":"အိုးအဖုံး ဖုံးလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S030","kind":"main","cn":"这个要炒多久？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ဘယ်လောက်ကြာကြာ ကြော်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S031","kind":"main","cn":"菜切好了吗？","meaning_my":"ဟင်းသီးဟင်းရွက်တွေ လှီးပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S031.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S032","kind":"main","cn":"帮我递一下盐。","meaning_my":"ဆား လှမ်းပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S032.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S033","kind":"main","cn":"锅里水烧干了。","meaning_my":"အိုးထဲက ရေခန်းသွားပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S033.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.03-S034","kind":"main","cn":"关火吧。","meaning_my":"မီးပိတ်လိုက်တော့။","audio_file":"03.02.03-S034.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我来洗碗。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်တွေ ဆေးလိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那我来擦桌子。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို စားပွဲကို သုတ်လိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我来刷碗。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်တွေ ဆေးလိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S002","kind":"main","cn":"洗洁精在哪儿？","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်ဆေးဆပ်ပြာရည် ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"在水槽旁边。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်ဆေးကန်ဘေးမှာ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S003","kind":"main","cn":"碗放这里吧。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်တွေ ဒီမှာထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S004","kind":"main","cn":"锅还没洗。","meaning_my":"အိုး မဆေးရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S005","kind":"main","cn":"都洗干净了吗？","meaning_my":"အကုန် သေချာ ဆေးပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S006","kind":"main","cn":"桌子擦一下。","meaning_my":"စားပွဲကို သုတ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S007","kind":"main","cn":"把垃圾倒了吧。","meaning_my":"အမှိုက် သွားပစ်လိုက်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S008","kind":"main","cn":"剩菜放冰箱。","meaning_my":"ကျန်တဲ့ဟင်းတွေကို ရေခဲသေတ္တာထဲ ထည့်ထား။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，我拿个盒子装起来。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဘူးတစ်ဘူးယူပြီး ထည့်ထားလိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S008_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"剩下的菜放冰箱里。","meaning_my":"ကျန်တဲ့ဟင်းတွေ ရေခဲသေတ္တာထဲ ထည့်ထား။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S008_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S009","kind":"main","cn":"这个锅有点难洗。","meaning_my":"ဒီအိုး ဆေးရ နည်းနည်း ခက်တယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S010","kind":"main","cn":"灶台也擦一下。","meaning_my":"မီးဖိုပေါ်လည်း သုတ်ပေးဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S011","kind":"main","cn":"灶台上都是油。","meaning_my":"မီးဖိုပေါ်မှာ ဆီတွေ ပေကျံနေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S012","kind":"main","cn":"碗先泡一下。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်တွေ အရင် ရေစိမ်ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S013","kind":"main","cn":"洗完记得把台面擦干。","meaning_my":"ဆေးပြီးရင် ကောင်တာပေါ်ကို ခြောက်အောင် သုတ်ဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S014","kind":"main","cn":"剩菜别在外面放太久。","meaning_my":"ကျန်တဲ့ဟင်းတွေကို အပြင်မှာ အကြာကြီး မထားနဲ့။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S015","kind":"main","cn":"碗洗完放架子上。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်ဆေးပြီးရင် စင်ပေါ် တင်ထား။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S016","kind":"main","cn":"这盘子还有点油。","meaning_my":"ဒီပန်းကန်မှာ ဆီ နည်းနည်း ကျန်သေးတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S017","kind":"main","cn":"水槽也冲一下。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်ဆေးကန်ကိုလည်း ရေနဲ့ ဆေးချလိုက်ဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S018","kind":"main","cn":"这个锅糊底了。","meaning_my":"ဒီအိုး အောက်ခြေ တူးသွားပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S019","kind":"main","cn":"冲干净。","meaning_my":"ရေနဲ့ သေချာ ဆေးချလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S020","kind":"main","cn":"碗要沥干。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်တွေ ရေစစ်ထားရမယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S021","kind":"main","cn":"垃圾记得分类。","meaning_my":"အမှိုက်ကို အမျိုးအစားခွဲပြီး ပစ်ဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S022","kind":"main","cn":"抹布洗一下。","meaning_my":"သန့်ရှင်းရေးသုံး အဝတ်စကို လျှော်လိုက်ဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S023","kind":"main","cn":"垃圾桶满了。","meaning_my":"အမှိုက်ပုံး ပြည့်နေပြီ။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.04-S024","kind":"main","cn":"筷子也洗一下。","meaning_my":"တူတွေလည်း ဆေးလိုက်ဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.04-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S001","kind":"main","cn":"房间有点乱。","meaning_my":"အခန်း နည်းနည်း ရှုပ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，我先收拾一下桌子。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ စားပွဲကို အရင် ရှင်းလိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"屋里有点乱。","meaning_my":"အိမ်ထဲ နည်းနည်း ရှုပ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S002","kind":"main","cn":"桌上东西太多了。","meaning_my":"စားပွဲပေါ်မှာ ပစ္စည်းတွေ များလွန်းတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S003","kind":"main","cn":"这个还要吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါ လိုသေးလား။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"还要，先别扔。","meaning_my":"လိုသေးတယ်၊ မပစ်နဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S004","kind":"main","cn":"这个先别扔。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို အခု မပစ်နဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S004_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"先别丢这个。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို အခု မပစ်နဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S004_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S005","kind":"main","cn":"都整理好了吗？","meaning_my":"အားလုံး စီပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"还没，抽屉还没收拾。","meaning_my":"မပြီးသေးဘူး၊ အံဆွဲ မရှင်းရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S006","kind":"main","cn":"这些要分开放吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါတွေ ခွဲပြီး ထားရမလား။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S007","kind":"main","cn":"不用的先放一边。","meaning_my":"မသုံးတဲ့ဟာတွေ အရင် ဘေးမှာထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S008","kind":"main","cn":"没用的东西一起扔了吧。","meaning_my":"အသုံးမဝင်တော့တဲ့ ပစ္စည်းတွေကို အတူတူ ပစ်လိုက်ရအောင်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S009","kind":"main","cn":"先把衣服分出来。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေကို အရင် ခွဲထုတ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S010","kind":"main","cn":"常用的放在好拿的地方。","meaning_my":"ခဏခဏသုံးတဲ့ ပစ္စည်းတွေ ယူရလွယ်တဲ့နေရာမှာ ထား။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S011","kind":"main","cn":"不用的先装箱。","meaning_my":"မသုံးတဲ့ဟာတွေ အရင် သေတ္တာထဲ ထည့်ထား။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S012","kind":"main","cn":"这堆衣服放哪儿？","meaning_my":"ဒီအဝတ်ပုံကို ဘယ်မှာထားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"放柜子里吧。","meaning_my":"ဗီရိုထဲ ထည့်ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S013","kind":"main","cn":"这边还没整理好。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက် မရှင်းရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S014","kind":"main","cn":"这个柜子放不下了。","meaning_my":"ဒီဗီရိုထဲ မဆံ့တော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S015","kind":"main","cn":"衣服叠好放柜子里。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ ခေါက်ပြီး ဗီရိုထဲ ထည့်ထား။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S015_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"把衣服叠好收起来。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်တွေ ခေါက်ပြီး သိမ်းထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S015_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S016","kind":"main","cn":"鞋子放到鞋架上。","meaning_my":"ဖိနပ်တွေ ဖိနပ်စင်ပေါ် ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S017","kind":"main","cn":"厚衣服收起来。","meaning_my":"အဝတ်ထူတွေ သိမ်းထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S018","kind":"main","cn":"这双鞋还要吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဖိနပ်တစ်ရံ လိုသေးလား။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S019","kind":"main","cn":"过期的扔掉。","meaning_my":"သက်တမ်းကုန်တဲ့ ပစ္စည်းတွေ ပစ်လိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S020","kind":"main","cn":"抽屉整理一下。","meaning_my":"အံဆွဲကို နည်းနည်း ရှင်းလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S021","kind":"main","cn":"贴个标签。","meaning_my":"အညွှန်းတစ်ခု ကပ်ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S022","kind":"main","cn":"这个盒子装什么？","meaning_my":"ဒီဘူးထဲ ဘာထည့်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"装不常用的东西。","meaning_my":"ခဏခဏ မသုံးတဲ့ ပစ္စည်းတွေ ထည့်ထား။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S022_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S023","kind":"main","cn":"这些放同一个柜子。","meaning_my":"ဒါတွေကို ဗီရိုတစ်ခုတည်းမှာ ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S024","kind":"main","cn":"先分类再收。","meaning_my":"အရင် အမျိုးအစားခွဲပြီးမှ သိမ်းလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S025","kind":"main","cn":"把药放在孩子够不着的地方。","meaning_my":"ဆေးတွေကို ကလေးတွေ လက်မလှမ်းမီတဲ့နေရာမှာ ထားလိုက်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.02.05-S026","kind":"main","cn":"收拾完看着舒服多了。","meaning_my":"ရှင်းပြီးတော့ ကြည့်ရတာ ပိုရှင်းလင်းသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.02.05-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
